    "paragraph": "Hierarchical forecast reconciliation for urban rail transit demand prediction under operational disruptions introduces a neural Fully Connected Reconciler framework that guarantees structural consistency between station-level and origin-destination passenger demand forecasts. Evolution and diffusion of time geography from 1970 to 2024 uses a scientometric analysis of 13,371 journal articles to map the cross-disciplinary spread of time geography. Improved EfficientNet Lingnan ancient village micro-space design style prediction model integrating multi-scale features creates a computable feature system encompassing visual characteristics, spatial form, component details, and cultural symbols to classify village micro-spaces.",
